000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SEARCH2.
000300* Table Handling level 2: serial SEARCH with a WHEN series, AT END
000400* and VARYING; DESCENDING KEY; and SEARCH ALL over two keys.
000410* VARYING an integer item: III-9 says it 'is incremented by the
000420* value one at the same time as the index', so N counts the
000430* steps taken. GnuCOBOL sets it to the index's value instead;
000440* the S2 and S3 lines were corrected by hand from the rule.
000500 DATA DIVISION.
000600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000700 01  T1.
000800     05  E1 OCCURS 6 TIMES INDEXED BY X1.
000900         10  K1       PIC 9(3).
001000         10  V1       PIC X(3).
001100 01  T2.
001200     05  E2 OCCURS 5 TIMES DESCENDING KEY IS K2 INDEXED BY X2.
001300         10  K2       PIC 9(3).
001400         10  V2       PIC X(3).
001500 01  T3.
001600     05  E3 OCCURS 6 TIMES ASCENDING KEY IS K3A K3B INDEXED BY X3.
001700         10  K3A      PIC 9(2).
001800         10  K3B      PIC 9(2).
001900         10  V3       PIC X(3).
002000 01  N            PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
002100 01  R            PIC X(3).
002200 01  IX-SHOW      PIC 9.
002300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002400 MAIN.
002500     MOVE 010 TO K1 (1). MOVE 'AAA' TO V1 (1).
002600     MOVE 020 TO K1 (2). MOVE 'BBB' TO V1 (2).
002700     MOVE 035 TO K1 (3). MOVE 'CCC' TO V1 (3).
002800     MOVE 040 TO K1 (4). MOVE 'DDD' TO V1 (4).
002900     MOVE 050 TO K1 (5). MOVE 'EEE' TO V1 (5).
003000     MOVE 060 TO K1 (6). MOVE 'FFF' TO V1 (6).
003100     SET X1 TO 1.
003200     SEARCH E1 AT END DISPLAY 'S1 NOT FOUND'
003300         WHEN K1 (X1) = 040 DISPLAY 'S1 40 ' V1 (X1)
003400         WHEN K1 (X1) > 030 DISPLAY 'S1 >30 ' V1 (X1).
003500     SET IX-SHOW TO X1.
003600     DISPLAY 'S1 X1=' IX-SHOW.
003700     SET X1 TO 1. MOVE 0 TO N.
003800     SEARCH E1 VARYING N AT END DISPLAY 'S2 NOT FOUND N=' N
003900         WHEN V1 (X1) = 'ZZZ' DISPLAY 'S2 WRONG'.
004000     SET X1 TO 2. MOVE 0 TO N.
004100     SEARCH E1 VARYING N AT END DISPLAY 'S3 NOT FOUND'
004200         WHEN K1 (X1) = 050 DISPLAY 'S3 FOUND N=' N.
004300     MOVE 090 TO K2 (1). MOVE 'AAA' TO V2 (1).
004400     MOVE 070 TO K2 (2). MOVE 'BBB' TO V2 (2).
004500     MOVE 050 TO K2 (3). MOVE 'CCC' TO V2 (3).
004600     MOVE 030 TO K2 (4). MOVE 'DDD' TO V2 (4).
004700     MOVE 010 TO K2 (5). MOVE 'EEE' TO V2 (5).
004800     SEARCH ALL E2 AT END DISPLAY 'S4 NOT FOUND'
004900         WHEN K2 (X2) = 030 DISPLAY 'S4 ' V2 (X2).
005000     SEARCH ALL E2 AT END DISPLAY 'S5 NOT FOUND'
005100         WHEN K2 (X2) = 090 DISPLAY 'S5 ' V2 (X2).
005200     SEARCH ALL E2 AT END DISPLAY 'S6 NOT FOUND'
005300         WHEN K2 (X2) = 040 DISPLAY 'S6 WRONG'.
005400     MOVE 01 TO K3A (1). MOVE 01 TO K3B (1). MOVE 'AAA' TO V3 (1).
005500     MOVE 01 TO K3A (2). MOVE 05 TO K3B (2). MOVE 'BBB' TO V3 (2).
005600     MOVE 02 TO K3A (3). MOVE 02 TO K3B (3). MOVE 'CCC' TO V3 (3).
005700     MOVE 02 TO K3A (4). MOVE 09 TO K3B (4). MOVE 'DDD' TO V3 (4).
005800     MOVE 03 TO K3A (5). MOVE 01 TO K3B (5). MOVE 'EEE' TO V3 (5).
005900     MOVE 03 TO K3A (6). MOVE 04 TO K3B (6). MOVE 'FFF' TO V3 (6).
006000     SEARCH ALL E3 AT END DISPLAY 'S7 NOT FOUND'
006100         WHEN K3A (X3) = 02 AND K3B (X3) = 09
006150             DISPLAY 'S7 ' V3 (X3).
006200     SEARCH ALL E3 AT END DISPLAY 'S8 NOT FOUND'
006300         WHEN K3A (X3) = 03 AND K3B (X3) = 01
006350             DISPLAY 'S8 ' V3 (X3).
006400     SEARCH ALL E3 AT END DISPLAY 'S9 NOT FOUND'
006500         WHEN K3A (X3) = 02 AND K3B (X3) = 03
006550             DISPLAY 'S9 WRONG'.
006600     STOP RUN.
